{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artificial Extinction 2</strong> is a <strong>tower defense hybrid</strong> that blends <strong>first-person shooter</strong> action with <strong>real-time strategy</strong> control. Survive on a hostile Earth against relentless AI overlords by building powerful defenses, managing resources, and fighting on the front lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a sentient AI commander, switching seamlessly between <strong>RTS command view</strong> to construct and upgrade your base, and <strong>FPS mode</strong> to engage enemies directly in brutal combat. Only by mastering both perspectives can you withstand the onslaught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/7cc7bd3b0e7f0efbc5398913887d9335.poster.avif?t=1770717464\" width=616 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/7cc7bd3b0e7f0efbc5398913887d9335.webm?t=1770717464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/7cc7bd3b0e7f0efbc5398913887d9335.mp4?t=1770717464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: <strong>defend your base until critical data decrypts</strong>, then call in your mothership for extraction. But the enemy is unrelenting \u2014 survival demands smart planning, quick thinking, and precise aim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/d26dd476054a2f46f9d70194bf45399a.poster.avif?t=1770717464\" width=616 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/d26dd476054a2f46f9d70194bf45399a.webm?t=1770717464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/d26dd476054a2f46f9d70194bf45399a.mp4?t=1770717464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Tower Defense Hybrid</strong> \u2013 Switch instantly between tactical RTS control and FPS combat.  <br>\u2022 <strong>Base Building &amp; Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Construct power generators, miners, and 8 turret types with unique upgrade paths.  <br>\u2022 <strong>Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Mine metal, uranium, and thorium while balancing energy and ammunition in real time.  <br>\u2022 <strong>Tech Tree Progression</strong> \u2013 Unlock new turrets and FPS weapons with a Quantum Computer.  <br>\u2022 <strong>Varied AI Enemies</strong> \u2013 Battle 8 mech classes, drones, robotic soldiers, and airborne threats.  <br>\u2022 <strong>Support Firepower</strong> \u2013 Call in a military drone and long-range artillery strikes.  <br>\u2022 <strong>Replayability</strong> \u2013 Procedural enemy attack paths, resource nodes, and base locations change each playthrough.  <br>\u2022 <strong>Leaderboards &amp; Modes</strong> \u2013 Compete globally and unlock challenges like:  <br>\u2003\u2003\u2022 Nightmare Mode  <br>\u2003\u2003\u2022 FPS-Only Mode  <br>\u2003\u2003\u2022 RTS-Only Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/7cacad636cbe8835d31baa3d3399f67e.poster.avif?t=1770717464\" width=616 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/7cacad636cbe8835d31baa3d3399f67e.webm?t=1770717464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/7cacad636cbe8835d31baa3d3399f67e.mp4?t=1770717464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign &amp; Replayability:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>10 handcrafted levels</strong>, each with unique terrain and tactical challenges. Replay to face new enemy attack patterns, resource layouts, and survival challenges. Every victory unlocks new ways to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re into <strong>strategic planning</strong>, <strong>intense FPS battles</strong>, or <strong>tower defense survival</strong>, <i>Artificial Extinction 2</i> delivers a fresh, high-stakes fight every time you play.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1570450?t=1770717464","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/a6ce55f144bc7fe689a9904d8801db665aeb36e8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770717464","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/ee288a0d501de9e1b9c0c2f25fe39a083b767062/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770717464","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/ee288a0d501de9e1b9c0c2f25fe39a083b767062/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770717464","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3860660,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artificial Extinction 2</strong> is a <strong>tower defense hybrid</strong> that blends <strong>first-person shooter</strong> action with <strong>real-time strategy</strong> control. Survive on a hostile Earth against relentless AI overlords by building powerful defenses, managing resources, and fighting on the front lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a sentient AI commander, switching seamlessly between <strong>RTS command view</strong> to construct and upgrade your base, and <strong>FPS mode</strong> to engage enemies directly in brutal combat. Only by mastering both perspectives can you withstand the onslaught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/7cc7bd3b0e7f0efbc5398913887d9335.poster.avif?t=1770717464\" width=616 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/7cc7bd3b0e7f0efbc5398913887d9335.webm?t=1770717464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/7cc7bd3b0e7f0efbc5398913887d9335.mp4?t=1770717464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: <strong>defend your base until critical data decrypts</strong>, then call in your mothership for extraction. But the enemy is unrelenting \u2014 survival demands smart planning, quick thinking, and precise aim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/d26dd476054a2f46f9d70194bf45399a.poster.avif?t=1770717464\" width=616 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/d26dd476054a2f46f9d70194bf45399a.webm?t=1770717464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/d26dd476054a2f46f9d70194bf45399a.mp4?t=1770717464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Tower Defense Hybrid</strong> \u2013 Switch instantly between tactical RTS control and FPS combat.  <br>\u2022 <strong>Base Building &amp; Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Construct power generators, miners, and 8 turret types with unique upgrade paths.  <br>\u2022 <strong>Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Mine metal, uranium, and thorium while balancing energy and ammunition in real time.  <br>\u2022 <strong>Tech Tree Progression</strong> \u2013 Unlock new turrets and FPS weapons with a Quantum Computer.  <br>\u2022 <strong>Varied AI Enemies</strong> \u2013 Battle 8 mech classes, drones, robotic soldiers, and airborne threats.  <br>\u2022 <strong>Support Firepower</strong> \u2013 Call in a military drone and long-range artillery strikes.  <br>\u2022 <strong>Replayability</strong> \u2013 Procedural enemy attack paths, resource nodes, and base locations change each playthrough.  <br>\u2022 <strong>Leaderboards &amp; Modes</strong> \u2013 Compete globally and unlock challenges like:  <br>\u2003\u2003\u2022 Nightmare Mode  <br>\u2003\u2003\u2022 FPS-Only Mode  <br>\u2003\u2003\u2022 RTS-Only Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/7cacad636cbe8835d31baa3d3399f67e.poster.avif?t=1770717464\" width=616 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/7cacad636cbe8835d31baa3d3399f67e.webm?t=1770717464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/7cacad636cbe8835d31baa3d3399f67e.mp4?t=1770717464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign &amp; Replayability:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>10 handcrafted levels</strong>, each with unique terrain and tactical challenges. Replay to face new enemy attack patterns, resource layouts, and survival challenges. Every victory unlocks new ways to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re into <strong>strategic planning</strong>, <strong>intense FPS battles</strong>, or <strong>tower defense survival</strong>, <i>Artificial Extinction 2</i> delivers a fresh, high-stakes fight every time you play.</p>","developers":["100Hr Games Inc"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/30b308f8b4da59603460b2f8b815387eddc8a0c3/header.jpg?t=1770717464","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1570450/828994156/ca00cbe934acb4a0ac514c417579a4c48b5bc1d8/1758285559/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759428628","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1570450/828994156/ca00cbe934acb4a0ac514c417579a4c48b5bc1d8/1758285559/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759428628","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1570450/828994156/ca00cbe934acb4a0ac514c417579a4c48b5bc1d8/1758285559/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759428628","id":257202129,"name":"Teaser English","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257202129/65406e652ecf8a6d359e26b12fe01d51dff1d31f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759428628"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1570450/2059206332/1c5727a6149a1f3917c758ba057f25e42eb26674/1754062076/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754073965","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1570450/2059206332/1c5727a6149a1f3917c758ba057f25e42eb26674/1754062076/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754073965","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1570450/2059206332/1c5727a6149a1f3917c758ba057f25e42eb26674/1754062076/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754073965","id":257176887,"name":"AE2DevelopmentTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets